sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    Note over WSS_A, Manager: 스케일아웃: WSS-C 신규 추가
    participant WSS_A as WSS A (기존 owner)
    participant Watcher as A의 Watcher
    participant Manager as A의 Manager
    participant Hub as A의 Hub (room R)
    participant Worker as Persist Worker
    participant ChatSvc as Chat Service
    participant Client as Client
    participant WSS_C as WSS C (새 owner)

    Note over WSS_A, WSS_C: 1. 멤버십 변경 감지
    WSS_C->>WSS_C: SET wss:member:C (부팅 시)
    Watcher->>Watcher: keyspace notification 수신
    Watcher->>Watcher: SCAN + ring.Set([A, B, C])
    Watcher->>Manager: events 채널 신호

    Note over WSS_A, WSS_C: 2. owner 재검사 (즉시 + 10초 ticker 안전망)
    Manager->>Manager: reconcileOwnership 호출
    Manager->>Manager: listRoomsCh로 hubs 스냅샷
    loop 각 보유 룸
        Manager->>Manager: ring.Locate(R) vs self
        alt mismatched (R의 새 owner = C)
            Manager->>Manager: scheduleRebalanceClose(R, jitter[0~10s])
        end
    end

    Note over WSS_A, WSS_C: 3. jitter 만료 후 강제 close (thundering herd 방지)
    Note over Manager: time.AfterFunc(jitter)
    Manager->>Hub: ForceCloseRoom(R)
    Hub->>Hub: beginDrain<br/>신규 register/broadcast 거절

    loop 이미 Hub에 들어온 메시지 처리
        Hub->>Hub: broadcastCh drain + fan-out
        Hub->>Worker: persistence task enqueue
        Worker->>ChatSvc: BatchCreateMessages
        ChatSvc-->>Worker: 저장 ack
        Worker-->>Hub: task ack<br/>pendingPersist 감소
    end

    alt drain 완료
        Hub->>Client: WebSocket close (모든 session)
        Hub-->>Manager: done
    else shutdown_timeout 만료
        Hub->>Hub: metric status=timeout 기록
        Hub->>Client: WebSocket close 계속 진행
        Hub-->>Manager: done
    end

    Note over WSS_A, WSS_C: 4. 클라이언트 자율 reconnect
    Client->>Client: ws.onclose → jittered backoff (1~30s)
    Client->>WSS_C: 재접속 (새 ring으로 라우팅됨)
    WSS_C->>WSS_C: self-check 통과 (R의 owner = C)
    WSS_C-->>Client: 정상 연결
    Note right of WSS_C: 송신 큐(disconnect 동안)는 replay,<br/>seq gap은 catch-up API로 보충
